.TH CHROOT 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
chroot \- changes the calling process root directory, normally requiring cap_sys_chroot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int chroot(const char* path);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes the calling process root directory, normally requiring CAP_SYS_CHROOT. It is not a complete security sandbox.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR chroot (2)
